    "changelog": "Initial pack — the statutory baseline that applies to every Nigerian company regardless of sector. Covers CAC annual returns and PSC filing, AGM and board meeting timing, companies income tax, VAT, PAYE, withholding tax, NSITF and pension remittance, plus the registrations (NDPC, NIPC, NOTAP, SCUML). Every date, threshold and penalty in this pack is drawn from the phase-8 research brief and has NOT been confirmed against the regulator’s primary document. The pack ships unverified: records are usable internally but excluded from generated regulatory submissions until a person verifies them (rule R10).",
